        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "target_route",
      "statement": "For inputs at least 2 * sizeof(unsigned) bytes long, the entry takes parser and renderer flags from the first two unsigned values and passes all remaining bytes to md_html. Its parser flag value can therefore contain the MD_FLAG_SPOILERS bit while the remaining bytes contain ||text||.",
