      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "consequence",
      "statement": "The after-source pipe analyzer resolves a potential closer against an available pipe opener; resolved two-character pipe marks dispatch MD_SPAN_SPOILER enter or leave callbacks, and the shown leave callback emits </x-spoiler>.",
